"votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473789185285568237", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177126108", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101995725", "personaname": "Frank Castle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/butrxslime/", "num_games_owned": 491, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 7051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4993, "deck_playtime_at_review": 241, "last_played": 1774693159, "avatar": "84c17025dd8c959d8605856ef3961a624a196309"}, "language": "english", "review": "A game where the developers are actually listening to the community and implementing new features and reworking existing features depending on player feedback.\n\nVery fun game with good and satisfying progression systems, with a lot of content to play through.", "timestamp_created": 1729035189, "timestamp_updated": 1730892760, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515442550182342529", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177126012", "author": {"steamid": "76561198385451411", "personaname": "deadlysinderellax", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198385451411/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 80, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 80, "last_played": 1729034541, "avatar": "5b8825b34c5d77b00c3a18897f2f1175fa0e0e57"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like this game. It's super fun. Why is there so much lag though. I went to avoid an enemy and it lagged and I had 5 enemies surrounding me and then I just couldn't dodge at all.", "timestamp_created": 1729035052, "timestamp_updated": 1729035052, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498199284076690674", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177119948", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066109579", "personaname": "Snow Bunny", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198066109579/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 14378, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14166, "last_played": 1731086932, "avatar": "343dab39597de5d25d02eab2b2fe48d8dde6ae0e"}, "language": "english", "review": "If they had a rating system I would rate the game 1/5 stars. The drop rates are a total joke, you can have 50 tries and not get a 10% item. Yet people that have spent a ton on the game get nothing but the item they are going for. \n\nTotal money grab and just a trash game plain and simple.\n\nI should mention it isn't terrible if all you want to do is talk to a friend that plays the game. Not the worst communication structure. Just avoid world chat at all costs! If you want to keep your sanity and not see people constantly talking about r and Diddy. \n\nThe lack of moderation is atrocious as it is nonexistent. Especially since the game is essentially filled with reddit trolls in the world chat. \n\nIf you want to find a game that is fun and engaging to play, I would highly advise looking elsewhere. This game is just full of items you have to pay real money for. And there is no trading system in place. \n\nAnd I say this loosely the so called free to play aspect of this game? Yeah, it might be free to play but to get a single item you are going to have to spend like 12 hours to get materials and then like 10 hours to craft it. If that isn't bad enough? The Ultimate Descendants take 18 hours to craft per piece. And then an additional 36 hours once all the parts are crafted! \n\nAnd if you think that isn't so bad? You are going to have to start all over once you get your character to level 40! Cause once you use a Catalyst then you are set back to level 1. And most builds require you to do this 8 times or more! \n\nThe whole game is nothing but grinding to make up for the fact that there is no actual content in the game. The story is boring, and the mechanics are horribly broken plain and simple. That is why I decided to make a more in depth review. To hopefully save people from making the mistake of playing the game. Or worse yet spending money on a bad game.", "timestamp_created": 1729025900, "timestamp_updated": 1729537344, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48370736837387085", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177119451", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055340761", "personaname": "jockothewolf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055340761/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 27563, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20062, "last_played": 1770460406, "avatar": "acf67207768cdc5be5f09aca6a9f7830bf27d6f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun but very griny", "timestamp_created": 1729025272, "timestamp_updated": 1729025272, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177114977", "author": {"steamid":